<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-COMMISSION APPROVES SAVINGS BANK SHARE SPLIT.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-COMMISSION APPROVES SAVINGS BANK SHARE SPLIT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's securities commission said on Monday that has it has registered a share split by Lithuanian Savings Bank.</p>
<p>One ordinary share of Savings Bank with a face value of 100 litas has been split into 10 ordinary shares with a face value of 10 litas, the commission said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
